enue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"FiWGTyWJs4p4dLQc8P6-pg","review_id":"eE7tob9iBUr4ZT-hJ1xTMA","date":"2013-11-03T19:04:50","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9228969812393188,"text_excerpt":"This place came recommended by two good friends of mine who's taste in food is highly trusted by me. After weeks of it being in my bookmarks, i finally made my way down to Broad and Bienville for one of those world famous grilled chicken sandwiches. The wait was brief, but the goods were every bit of goodness! I ordered the whole because i was told it could serve as two meals (depending on how hungry you are, you could probably do it all in one sitting). It's been a couple weeks since my first visit but as i'm revisiting this place and my experience in my head, i think it's time for another stop in. Saints game is on tho, it'll have to wait until halftime :) #WhoDat!"},{"business_id":"FiWGTyWJs4p4dLQc8P6-pg","review_id":"AFXaQjIxlRvPyDP7U5h03w","date":"2020-10-01T22:58:11","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.911464512348175,"text_excerpt":"This spot was amazing! I been wanting to try it and heard the great words of how much you get when you order I went with the chicken rice plate. When I tell you my lunch was my left overs for dinner as well with how much food I have gotten from them. They stated it was a healthy option I would say so myself but it was slightly oily for my tasting. Coming back to try their stuffed potatoes next time!"},{"business_id":"FiWGTyWJs4p4dLQc8P6-pg","review_id":"SdqqrCdTp_jXQxmZLpHECw","date":"2014-11-24T14:32:07","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9087154269218445,"text_excerpt":"I had the salad, with salmon. Best salad I've had in a while. Very filling. Cook a and cashier were very nice. I'll definitely return to this place to try more things."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"FiW